      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5565185546875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "monoresistance) receiving treatment for MDR-TB, but without clofazimine, and with moxifloxacin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.5596313476562,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "replaced by levofloxacin and a baseline QTcF of less than 450 ms. In addition to the MDR-TB treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969959259033203,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.404541015625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "regimen with the conditions described above, the regimens used in the three study arms comprised",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4257202148438,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "the addition of bedaquiline 400 mg once daily for 2 weeks, then 200 mg thrice weekly for 22 weeks;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.4235229492188,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "the addition of delamanid 100 mg twice daily for 24 weeks; and the addition of both bedaquiline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.43994140625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "and delamanid. The primary objective of the trial was to compare the mean change from baseline in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.4265747070312,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "QTcF (averaged over weeks 8–24) when bedaquiline and delamanid were co-administered with the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        373.3738098144531,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "mean change observed when each drug was administered alone.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.49464416503906,
        527.5505981445312,
        195.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "In addition to the data reviewed for PICO questions 1–2019 and 2–2019, the GDG 2019 was provided",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983988761901855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69459533691406,
        527.194580078125,
        209.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "with and reviewed data from a study in South Africa on the use of bedaquiline during pregnancy. This",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98819351196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4276733398438,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "observational cohort study included information from 108 pregnant women with RR-TB who were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.4002685546875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "recruited from one MDR/RR-TB referral hospital in South Africa between January 2013 and December",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973618507385254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.3345336914062,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "2017. As part of their MDR/RR-TB regimen, 58 women received bedaquiline; they were compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.960930824279785,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        527.4442138671875,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "50 women who had no bedaquiline in their regimen. The women in this study gave birth to 109 live",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.5266723632812,
        275.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "infants, of whom 49 had bedaquiline exposure in utero and 60 had no bedaquiline exposure in utero.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990745544433594,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.1587524414062,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "Clinical assessments were carried out at 2, 6 and 12 months after birth to document infant outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988393783569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.3031005859375,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "The main objective of the study was to document treatment, pregnancy and infant outcomes among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994248390197754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        395.3321533203125,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "women treated for RR-TB with second-line TB drugs during pregnancy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.3890991210938,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "When reviewing evidence and formulating the recommendations, the GDG 2019 considered the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        527.3793334960938,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "need for the guidelines to also cater to key subgroups that were not well represented in the 2018",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        348.39862060546875,
        527.07568359375,
        362.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "IPD meta-analysis – notably, children. Where data on children were unavailable, evidence from adults",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988994598388672,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        527.4442749023438,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "was extrapolated to children. The best available evidence was used to construct recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        527.4168090820312,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "for a regimen that has high relapse-free cure rates, and that reduces the likelihood of death and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        527.51806640625,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "emergence of additional resistance while minimizing harms. The GDG 2019 was aware of the paediatric",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951191902160645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        527.5875244140625,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB IPD meta-analysis on 975 clinically diagnosed or bacteriologically confirmed pulmonary",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.12261962890625,
        527.4194946289062,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "(71) or extrapulmonary TB cases that was used for the 2016 treatment recommendations  . Children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        426.3226013183594,
        527.4349365234375,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "n with XDR-TB (pre-2021 definition) were excluded from that analysis ( =36) because their treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        527.4573974609375,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "regimens were not considered to be comparable with those of other MDR-TB patients, and their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        527.4224243164062,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "numbers were too low to be analysed independently. No RCTs were included (or known to exist) at",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1986083984375,
        527.3782958984375,
        481.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "the time this dataset was compiled, and the overall certainty in the estimates of effect based on this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.39862060546875,
        527.4234008789062,
        494.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "evidence was judged to be very low. However, in July 2019, preliminary data from the DELIBERATE",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.5986022949219,
        527.4299926757812,
        508.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "trial were made available to the GDG 2019 to partly address PICO question 9; the overall certainty",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.798583984375,
        351.06915283203125,
        521.2415771484375
      ],
      "text": "in the estimates of effect for this study was judged to be low.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.6099243164062,
        509.38104248046875,
        545.9649047851562
      ],
      "text": "PICO question 1–2021 (Childhood TB, 2021) (use of bedaquiline in MDR/RR-TB patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
