      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        568.423828125,
        527.5567626953125,
        582.8668212890625
      ],
      "text": "To answer the PICO question on the use of bedaquiline in children aged below 6 years, data from two",
