      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.96479320526123,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.423828125,
        524.40966796875,
        648.8668212890625
      ],
      "text": "confirmed or clinically diagnosed pulmonary and selected forms of extrapulmonary MDR-TB. 41",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.623779296875,
        527.3839111328125,
        662.0667724609375
      ],
      "text": "IMPAACT P1108 is a Phase 1–2 dose finding modified age de-escalation study to evaluate the",
